                    <div><strong>• Calculated Dose (mg):</strong> <span style="color:#0369a1; font-weight:800;">${calculatedMg.toFixed(1)} mg</span> (${drug.mgPerKg} mg/kg)</div>
                    <div><strong>• Calculated Volume (ml):</strong> <span style="color:#16a34a; font-weight:800;">${calculatedMl} ml</span></div>
                    <div><strong>• Administration Schedule:</strong> ${drug.frequency}</div>
                    <div style="margin-top:0.4rem; color:#b45309;"><strong><i class="fas fa-shield-halved"></i> Guidance:</strong> ${drug.notes}</div>
                </div>
            `;
        }

